7302212", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035381_1797573670635545_6197824967006157093_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2Gb3AkvOagQ7kNvwFcPcMa&_nc_oc=Adom_VrsIssdpJP6PDHlgQPlVeChyXDPRvDxL69xIQMGCkC9g9BCvnS8IJFavY-0aSc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQm_aHFTy_kR6xeOKT7vRPqkVEu_GMlqHYVVqGphCBd6Q&oe=6B0B31E6"}, {"file_name": "Oculus_4.png", "id": "608709407673137", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974653_608709411006470_3724841126535739474_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ERZYfIm3o04Q7kNvwHxlReG&_nc_oc=AdrMGIxJM5iswHJUJkDUJXSXg2lKI-t9S2xq3noNaBH5Ae3k4fgDQLuu6fxbqMq3guw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQmOQvOmb0r_JitJt75BhY_tdyel5c9b2EKIjEUuVRGkw&oe=6B0B0E6F"}, {"file_name": "Oculus_1.png", "id": "671400577996935", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984463_671400581330268_197625172305425973_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UP07xuqBobsQ7kNvwGTV7tx&_nc_oc=AdqVlXY46cVWT-S1nlhxL9ZsyfUDD5o4ZpOb7SaFtsGnAD07y7Bo_jIW-qmoRazjosg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ5PMsflBkDPbghcJBPnowSqhYVDjmsb4fQk9iqFuGMTQ&oe=6B0B3346"}, {"file_name": "Oculus_5.png", "id": "538856954299143", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974732_538856957632476_6918006955522933773_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R9jbyPYUlM0Q7kNvwF11nnI&_nc_oc=Ado8W8hAiXEicLmIKQiu4mDvFICNbT5udAWcnkjWXHcajG62a-mghn1wAi_Gc8_DSX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTDDyukZ3kdDqCT9iPJC_3mHSnh3JJ-nP0F1qZ162Cdwg&oe=6B0B1812"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailerSS.png", "id": "1278403852704227", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262739_1278403856037560_4027310344721401225_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N9DPxLbYxqoQ7kNvwEYWsk7&_nc_oc=AdqId1pB9A5FHCFuCZ64s6jeIjQ9rgrSjw2P1SdOx8AzVWKiA8BtakalYQJLfz5sbWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSpTmz4dkyuKQjEu10aSEjdh9PV2N5tr5uQmdbIRvBt8Q&oe=6B0B254B"}, "display_name": "Oracle ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A derelict Space Station containing hazardous research and technology has become the target of attack by hostile forces that appear to be the plundering the vessel.\n\nYou, an augmented super soldier from a by-gone era have been re-activated after a long period inactivity under emergency protocols to assist in the defense and repair of the station.\n\nIt is unknown what happened to the original crew or what the effects of long term cryogenic suspension are. But one thing is for sure, you still know how to neutralize any hostile with extreme lethality.\n\nNot all is as it seems onboard the classified and forgotten facility.\n\nA short single-player experience.\n\nVR FPS with Point to Teleport and Orient movement , designed for comfort with minimal motion sickness, standing or sitting.\n\nOracle was created under certain \"Game Content Usage Rules\", and is a derivative work. See the notice on our website for more info.", "short_description": "Awoken from an extended stasis having no memory, you must defend the facility from hostiles and take control of the situation.\n\nA single-player Sci-fi VR Shooter with Point to Teleport (and Orient) movement mechanics.\n\nOracle was created under certain \"Game Content Usage Rules\", and is a derivative work. See the notice on our website for more info."}]}, "developer_name": "Council Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/sykes.co.nz/theoracle/privacy-policy-and-notices", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Council Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/sykes.co.nz/the